1. Brute Force:
- Compare each element with every other element
- If any match → duplicate found
- Time: O(n²)

2. Better Approach (Sorting):
- Sort the array
- Check adjacent elements for equality
- Time: O(n log n), Space: O(1)

3. Optimal Approach (HashSet):
- Use a HashSet to track seen elements
- If element already exists → duplicate found
- Time: O(n), Space: O(n)

Decision:
- Use HashSet for best time complexity
- Use sorting if space is constrained
